                                                "sense_id": "33c944cf-2a5b-3077-8ace-6d24e9b44580",
                                                "text": "Driving down your freeways / Midnight alleys roam / Cops in cars, the topless bars / Never saw a woman so alone"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1ca481e-5d24-447d-8348-12e7654c5fba",
                                                "sense_id": "33c944cf-2a5b-3077-8ace-6d24e9b44580",
                                                "text": "She was workin' in a topless place / And I stopped in for beer / I just kept lookin' at the side of her face / In the spotlight so clear."
                                            }
